<title>UK: Genfinance adds 700 mln Luxfr to Dec 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance adds 700 mln Luxfr to Dec 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 3.7 billion Lux francs from 3.0 billion francs, joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Generale Bank said.</p>
<p>The deal was launched on May 12.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE SA LUX</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GENERALE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    3.7 BLN FLUX  COUPON   **5.0	 MATURITY    27.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE   L27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN 7.50 PCT</p>
<p>		L-LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
